{"assets":["/statement-assets/8553c1d6a3900a89b8dad2fbf7bcf5d5ed52b783662586ca47a6d850deb37e9d.png","/statement-assets/e9d1c15a53aaf011f5a71c25840be2068761633e30ced57b4e649fa1ec3b8c41.png","/statement-assets/07655bf2a1d47c33fa3735f16fd8986a356ef1f2cfe8a4d64ab8265dafec78f2.png","/statement-assets/490f044411db3323c8c6838ac7e6f966ed969c227f8b623392c768cfb743357c.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1510","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Fiber Shape"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Imagine a board with $$$n$$$ pins put into it, the $$$i$$$-th pin is located at $$$(x_i, y_i)$$$. For simplicity, we will restrict the problem to the case where the pins are placed in vertices of a convex polygon."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then, take a non-stretchable string of length $$$l$$$, and put it around all the pins. Place a pencil inside the string and draw a curve around the pins, trying to pull the string in every possible direction. The picture below shows an example of a string tied around the pins and pulled by a pencil (a point $$$P$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/8553c1d6a3900a89b8dad2fbf7bcf5d5ed52b783662586ca47a6d850deb37e9d.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to find an area inside this curve. Formally, for a given convex polygon $$$S$$$ and a length $$$l$$$ let's define a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fiber shape"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$F(S, l)$$$ as a set of points $$$t$$$ such that the perimeter of the convex hull of $$$S \\cup \\{t\\}$$$ does not exceed $$$l$$$. Find an area of $$$F(S, l)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$l$$$ ($$$3 \\le n \\le 10^4$$$; $$$1 \\le l \\le 8 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of vertices of the polygon $$$S$$$ and the length of the string. Next $$$n$$$ lines contain integers $$$x_i$$$ and $$$y_i$$$ ($$$-10^5 \\le x_i, y_i \\le 10^5$$$) — coordinates of polygon's vertices in counterclockwise order. All internal angles of the polygon are strictly less than $$$\\pi$$$. The length $$$l$$$ exceeds the perimeter of the polygon by at least $$$10^{-3}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single floating-point number — the area of the fiber shape $$$F(S, l)$$$. Your answer will be considered correct if its absolute or relative error doesn't exceed $$$10^{-6}$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 4\n0 0\n1 0\n0 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3.012712585980357\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4 5\n0 0\n1 0\n1 1\n0 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5.682061989789656\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 17\n0 0\n2 -1\n3 0\n4 3\n-1 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n37.719371276930820\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following pictures illustrate the example tests."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/e9d1c15a53aaf011f5a71c25840be2068761633e30ced57b4e649fa1ec3b8c41.png"},"kind":"image"},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/07655bf2a1d47c33fa3735f16fd8986a356ef1f2cfe8a4d64ab8265dafec78f2.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/490f044411db3323c8c6838ac7e6f966ed969c227f8b623392c768cfb743357c.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1510F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1510/problem/F"}